{
    "word": "bowed",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9d9cce64-a51e-3e23-bbc0-37fd2339eb78",
                "word": "bowed",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ae7ac49-33ce-37a2-84f8-aa56241655d0",
                        "entry_id": "9d9cce64-a51e-3e23-bbc0-37fd2339eb78",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a bow (rod for playing stringed instruments)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0e75316-5742-4990-af9d-5b2fc5daeea6",
                                "sense_id": "1ae7ac49-33ce-37a2-84f8-aa56241655d0",
                                "text": "The viol, he argued, was in essence a bowed guitar, the result of a cross-fertilisation between the 15th-century Spanish plucked instrument known as the vihuela de mano and the medieval fiddle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eca856cf-0220-4677-8ebf-2c092bb5342f",
                                "sense_id": "1ae7ac49-33ce-37a2-84f8-aa56241655d0",
                                "text": "Heading over to the MacLeod Centre for some fresh air and a quick bowl of soup— forcing myself out of my little office, narrow work-self, out of the head-down attitude that I must finish what I;ve started — and turning the corner, I see a woman in a gold lame/ jacket and woollen hat with earflaps, playing some sort of stringed instrument in the sun. A bowed sultry, somebody says. 'A bowed what?' 'Psalter — as in psalm.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "970fbe32-56ce-4f4e-aff9-9a7dd00c6ee9",
                                "sense_id": "1ae7ac49-33ce-37a2-84f8-aa56241655d0",
                                "text": "a bowed instrument"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f40f222-f1f7-326c-849f-02f8d55b7c99",
                        "entry_id": "9d9cce64-a51e-3e23-bbc0-37fd2339eb78",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having been played by a bow (rod for playing stringed instruments)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c43e895-ac1d-4821-a936-2cc0fada86b4",
                                "sense_id": "8f40f222-f1f7-326c-849f-02f8d55b7c99",
                                "text": "The value 16/49 is evidently of importance as it corresponds to the first principal mode of vibration of a bowed string."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ab46a3d-a713-49c3-87cd-107a90b3894e",
                                "sense_id": "8f40f222-f1f7-326c-849f-02f8d55b7c99",
                                "text": "The mode of vibration of a bowed string is peculiar, since it is not a simple harmonic motion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b86c7123-5bc6-4722-85b1-88afc514d9dc",
                                "sense_id": "8f40f222-f1f7-326c-849f-02f8d55b7c99",
                                "text": "Today, the behavior of bowed string instruments is reasonably well understood, and efficient synthesis algorithms allow us to reproduce most of the phenomena that appear in real instruments."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68d87394-e755-46c6-abf2-8eadd8b5be07",
                                "sense_id": "8f40f222-f1f7-326c-849f-02f8d55b7c99",
                                "text": "The motion of a bowed string has interested physicists for many years, and much has been written on the subject."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "276e14cd-d7b6-305a-bbd8-650cd86d1609",
                        "entry_id": "9d9cce64-a51e-3e23-bbc0-37fd2339eb78",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Equipped with a bow (weapon)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "in-compounds",
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e99a6ae4-2181-48a8-9dd5-dd3341417003",
                                "sense_id": "276e14cd-d7b6-305a-bbd8-650cd86d1609",
                                "text": "[…] the deadly fight / At Sparta sing, that nigh / Kithairon’s heiglits was fought, whereby / The Persian host of bent-bowed archers came / To ruin; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8ff1386-4b3d-4d80-b1dd-d8278f904063",
                                "sense_id": "276e14cd-d7b6-305a-bbd8-650cd86d1609",
                                "text": "Now some of our weak-bowed archers are using glass sights on their bows for 100-yard shooting."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "695fa9d4-c7f4-4ff8-8877-7aaac2dc14f1",
                                "sense_id": "276e14cd-d7b6-305a-bbd8-650cd86d1609",
                                "text": "Apollo, augur, bright-bowed archer, well-loved / Music-master of the nine Muses, healer / Whose skill in medicine can ease the body’s / Ills and infirmities, / By thy affection for the Palatine altars / Prolong, we pray, the Roman State and Latium’s / Prosperity into future cycles, nobler / Eras, for evermore."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92be3be4-2d05-4b2d-89c9-0f0519b5e5c7",
                                "sense_id": "276e14cd-d7b6-305a-bbd8-650cd86d1609",
                                "text": "Say, is He Zeus? or perhaps He’s the silver-bowed archer Apollo?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "811ef297-8b10-4fab-86a4-0700a9462b30",
                                "sense_id": "276e14cd-d7b6-305a-bbd8-650cd86d1609",
                                "text": "Let the strong-bowed archers draw their bows."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48029600-37fa-4fe6-bdbc-4d3a4ad8fd3a",
                                "sense_id": "276e14cd-d7b6-305a-bbd8-650cd86d1609",
                                "text": "My speed was like that of a light arrow easily shot by a firm-bowed archer—one trained, skillful, and experienced—across the shadow of a palmyra tree."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fb668a4d-0cb6-39df-8a42-ede9a31a8313",
                        "entry_id": "9d9cce64-a51e-3e23-bbc0-37fd2339eb78",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Bent or curved."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6136494e-2993-46ac-8dc2-84422cecfa4a",
                                "sense_id": "fb668a4d-0cb6-39df-8a42-ede9a31a8313",
                                "text": "Replace any badly bowed studs, or fix a bowed stud by making a cut into the bowed area, forcing the stud straight, and bracing it with a 1x cleat (see the bottom illustration at right)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4c3a34c-58b3-49bb-9283-b87d4046f2c7",
                                "sense_id": "fb668a4d-0cb6-39df-8a42-ede9a31a8313",
                                "text": "A bowed tendon is one of the most serious leg problems for racehorses ."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
